                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                Unemployment rates are down since April but remain very elevated. Net increases since February have been larger for nonwhites than for whites.
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200902/sp-20200902-img-03-lg.jpg?w=991&hash=94859339D3B5C424DDD613F332EC99B0" alt="Figure 3. Unemployment rates are down since April but remain very elevated. Net increases since February have been larger for nonwhites than for whites." sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200902/sp-20200902-img-03-lg.jpg?w=991&amp;hash=94859339D3B5C424DDD613F332EC99B0 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200902/sp-20200902-img-03-lg.jpg?w=800&amp;hash=31630E74D58C924D7527D6FCA24591F9 800w" />
    </figure>

